    "Woman with umbrella | walking toward camera, open blue umbrella held aloft in left hand, red apple carried in right hand | close-up profile view, umbrella still open overhead, apple still at her right hand | continuous forward walk; no state change in umbrella or apple",
    "Blue umbrella | open and held above woman from first frame | open and still above her at final frame | no opening/closing event occurs; position tracks her movement continuously",
    "Red apple | held in woman's right hand at chest height | resting at her right palm in final frame | carried steadily; no independent motion, no impact events",
    "Market pedestrians | multiple people walking through the aisle toward/past camera | exit frame edges progressively | continuous walking motion, no teleporting or direction changes without cause",
    "Camera | wide shot down market aisle | tight close-up of woman with motion blur on final frame | continuous push-in/orbit; motion blur consistent with rapid camera movement"
